.Dd May 29, 2026
.Dt ZDOTS-PHI-SAFETY 7
.Os zdots
.Sh NAME
.Nm zdots-phi-safety
.Nd PHI safety boundaries for zdots
.Sh DESCRIPTION
Zdots defaults to local AI and opt-in capture. PHI-related controls are enforced
through environment gates, prompt scrubbing, history redaction, database
encryption checks, and macOS unified logging.
.Sh HARD DEFAULTS
.Bl -tag -width ZDOTS_CAPTURE_ENABLED
.It Ev ZDOTS_AI_MODE=local
Inference stays local unless explicitly reviewed.
.It Ev ZDOTS_CAPTURE_ENABLED=0
Session capture disabled by default.
.It Ev ZDOTS_HISTORY_REDACT=1
History redaction enabled by default.
.It Ev ZDOTS_CMD_ANALYTICS=0
Analytics disabled on work machines.
.El
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr phi-patterns.yaml 5 ,
.Xr zdots-ctx 1 ,
.Xr ai-query 1
